     <string name="privacy_policy_s2_title">2. Cihaz \u00DCzerinde \u0130\u015Fleme</string>
     <string name="privacy_policy_s2_body">Sohbetleriniz, sistem istemleriniz ve modelin yan\u0131tlar\u0131, cihaz\u0131n\u0131zda yerel olarak \u00E7al\u0131\u015Fan model taraf\u0131ndan i\u015Flenir. Bu i\u00E7erik, \u00E7\u0131kar\u0131m i\u00E7in asla bana veya herhangi bir sunucuya g\u00F6nderilmez. A\u015Fa\u011F\u0131da a\u00E7\u0131kland\u0131\u011F\u0131 gibi internete eri\u015Fen bir \u00F6zelli\u011Fi kullanmay\u0131 se\u00E7medi\u011Finiz s\u00FCrece cihaz\u0131n\u0131zda kal\u0131r.</string>
     <string name="privacy_policy_s3_title">3. \u0130nternet Eri\u015Fimi</string>
-    <string name="privacy_policy_s3_body">LM Playground, iki ama\u00E7 i\u00E7in internet izni ister: se\u00E7ti\u011Finiz model dosyalar\u0131n\u0131 indirmek ve \u2014 yaln\u0131zca a\u00E7arsan\u0131z \u2014 iste\u011Fe ba\u011Fl\u0131 web ara\u00E7lar\u0131n\u0131 \u00E7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rmak. Uygulamada reklam, telemetri veya kullan\u0131m analizi yoktur ve etkinli\u011Finizi bana bildirmez.</string>
