     <string name="privacy_policy_s4_title">4. Ara\u00E7lar ve Web Eri\u015Fimi</string>
     <string name="privacy_policy_s4_body">Yetenekli modeller, varsay\u0131lan olarak kapal\u0131 olan iste\u011Fe ba\u011Fl\u0131 ara\u00E7lar\u0131 kullanabilir. Web ara\u00E7lar\u0131n\u0131 etkinle\u015Ftirdi\u011Finizde baz\u0131 bilgiler cihaz\u0131n\u0131zdan \u00E7\u0131kar: Web aramas\u0131 arac\u0131, modelin arama sorgusunu DuckDuckGo\'ya g\u00F6nderir ve Web sayfas\u0131 getir arac\u0131, modelin a\u00E7maya karar verdi\u011Fi sayfalar\u0131 o web sitelerinden indirir. Bu istekler, \u00FC\u00E7\u00FCnc\u00FC taraf siteler taraf\u0131ndan kendi gizlilik politikalar\u0131 kapsam\u0131nda i\u015Flenir \u2014 ben bunlar\u0131 ne al\u0131r\u0131m ne de saklar\u0131m. JavaScript \u00E7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r arac\u0131 ise tamamen cihaz\u0131n\u0131zda, internet eri\u015Fimi olmayan bir korumal\u0131 alanda \u00E7al\u0131\u015F\u0131r. Her \u015Feyi \u00E7evrimd\u0131\u015F\u0131 tutmak i\u00E7in ara\u00E7lar\u0131 yaln\u0131zca kapal\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131n.</string>
